
--- NOVA PR MANIFEST ---
PR Title: ⚡️ NOVA: Obstacle Rendering Fix & Match-3 Determinism
Description:
- Fixes critical bug in main.js where negative tiers (obstacles/roads) were clamped to Tier 1, causing them to render as cottages.
- Exposed window.gameInterval to allow deterministic testing scripts to pause the game loop.
- Refactored verify_match3.py to verify cell availability and handle game loops robustly.
- Verified visual fidelity via Playwright video CUJ and screenshots.
Status: READY
